msgid "Unused net class: '{0}'"
msgstr "Net class ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້: '{0}'"

#: libs/librepcb/core/project/erc/electricalrulecheckmessages.cpp:131
msgctxt "ErcMsgUnusedNetClass"
msgid "There are no nets assigned to the net class, so you could remove it."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີເນັດໃດໆຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ net class ນີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດເອົາມັນອອກໄດ້."

#: libs/librepcb/core/export/excellongenerator.cpp:185
msgctxt "ExcellonGenerator"
msgid "Using the G85 slot command is not possible for curved slots. Either remove curved slots or disable the G85 export option."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ G85 slot ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບຮ່ອງທີ່ໂຄ້ງໄດ້. ກະລຸນາເອົາຮ່ອງໂຄ້ງອອກ ຫຼື ປິດຕົວເລືອກການສົ່ງອອກ G85."

