#: libs/librepcb/editor/project/componentassemblyoptionlisteditorwidget.cpp:234
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::ComponentAssemblyOptionListEditorWidget"
msgid ""
"The selected device is not related to the component placed in the schematic, thus LibrePCB cannot validate if it is compatible!\n"
"\n"
"Are you sure the footprint and pinout of the selected device are compatible with the component?"
msgstr ""
"ອຸປະກອນທີ່ເລືອກບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບສ່ວນປະກອບທີ່ວາງໄວ້ໃນຜັງວົງຈອນ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ LibrePCB ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດກວດສອບຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້!\n"
"\n"
"ເຈົ້າມັ້ນໃຈບໍ່ວ່າ ຟຸດພຣິນ (Footprint) ແລະ ການຈັດວາງຂາຂອງອຸປະກອນທີ່ເລືອກນັ້ນ ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບສ່ວນປະກອບນີ້?"

#: libs/librepcb/editor/project/componentassemblyoptionlisteditorwidget.cpp:300
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::ComponentAssemblyOptionListEditorWidget"
msgid "Part Compatibility Unknown"
msgstr "ບໍ່ຮູ້ຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ຂອງຊິ້ນສ່ວນ"

#: libs/librepcb/editor/project/componentassemblyoptionlisteditorwidget.cpp:301
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::ComponentAssemblyOptionListEditorWidget"
msgid ""
"The selected part is taken from a different device than this assembly option is valid for, thus LibrePCB cannot validate if it is compatible!\n"
"\n"
"Are you sure the footprint and pinout of the selected part are compatible with the device?"
msgstr ""
"ຊິ້ນສ່ວນທີ່ເລືອກມາຈາກອຸປະກອນທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກຕົວເລືອກການປະກອບນີ້, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ LibrePCB ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດກວດສອບຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້!\n"
"\n"
"ເຈົ້າມັ້ນໃຈບໍ່ວ່າ ຟຸດພຣິນ (Footprint) ແລະ ການຈັດວາງຂາຂອງຊິ້ນສ່ວນທີ່ເລືອກນັ້ນ ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບອຸປະກອນນີ້?"

#: libs/librepcb/editor/project/componentassemblyoptionlisteditorwidget.cpp:512
