msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດເປີດໂຟນເດີ \"{0}\" ໄດ້ ເພາະວ່າມັນຖືກເປີດໂດຍ \"{1}\" ຢູ່. ກະລຸນາປິດແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອື່ນທີ່ໃຊ້ໂຟນເດີນີ້ແລ້ວລອງໃໝ່."

#: libs/librepcb/editor/dialogs/directorylockhandlerdialog.ui:52
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::DirectoryLockHandlerDialog"
msgid "If you're absolutely sure that the directory is not accessed by any other application instance anymore, you could discard the current lock and open this directory anyway. But if the directory is still accessed by another application instance, this could lead in corrupt files, so use this option very carefully!"
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າມັ້ນໃຈແທ້ໆວ່າໂຟນເດີນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອື່ນແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດປົດລັອກ ແລະ ເປີດໂຟນເດີນີ້ໄດ້ເລີຍ. ແຕ່ຖ້າມີແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອື່ນຍັງໃຊ້ຢູ່, ມັນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ເສຍຫາຍໄດ້, ກະລຸນາໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ດ້ວຍຄວາມລະມັດລະວັງ!"

#: libs/librepcb/editor/dialogs/directorylockhandlerdialog.cpp:53
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::DirectoryLockHandlerDialog"
msgid "I accept the risk."
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍຍອມຮັບຄວາມສ່ຽງ."

#: libs/librepcb/editor/dialogs/directorylockhandlerdialog.cpp:58
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::DirectoryLockHandlerDialog"
msgid "Open anyway"
msgstr "ເປີດຕໍ່ໄປ"

