msgstr "ຕົວຄູນມາດຕາສ່ວນ:"

#: libs/librepcb/editor/dialogs/dxfimportdialog.ui:60
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::DxfImportDialog"
msgid ""
"Additional scale factor, in case the DXF is not scaled properly.\n"
"Note: If you have issues with scaling, make sure to configure the measuring unit of the DXF in your MCAD."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄູນມາດຕາສ່ວນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ DXF ມີມາດຕາສ່ວນບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"ໝາຍເຫດ: ຖ້າເຈົ້າມີບັນຫາກັບມາດຕາສ່ວນ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຫົວໜ່ວຍວັດແທກຂອງ DXF ໃນໂປຣແກຣມ MCAD ຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#: libs/librepcb/editor/dialogs/dxfimportdialog.ui:80
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::DxfImportDialog"
msgid "Position:"
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງ:"

#: libs/librepcb/editor/dialogs/dxfimportdialog.ui:87
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::DxfImportDialog"
msgid ""
"If checked (the default), you can interactively place the imported objects by cursor.\n"
"If unchecked, you need to specify exact coordinates where the point (0,0) of the DXF will be located."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເລືອກ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ເຈົ້າສາມາດວາງວັດຖຸທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າໄດ້ດ້ວຍເຄີເຊີ (Cursor).\n"
"ຖ້າບໍ່ເລືອກ, ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງກຳນົດພິກັດທີ່ແນ່ນອນຂອງຈຸດ (0,0) ຂອງ DXF."

#: libs/librepcb/editor/dialogs/dxfimportdialog.ui:91
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::DxfImportDialog"
msgid "Interactive"
msgstr "ໂຕ້ຕອບ (Interactive)"

#: libs/librepcb/editor/dialogs/dxfimportdialog.ui:100
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::DxfImportDialog"
msgid "X-coordinate."
msgstr "ພິກັດ X."

#: libs/librepcb/editor/dialogs/dxfimportdialog.ui:107
