msgid "Options:"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກ:"

#: libs/librepcb/editor/dialogs/dxfimportdialog.ui:123
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::DxfImportDialog"
msgid ""
"If checked, tangent polylines of the DXF will be joined together.\n"
"Helps for example to avoid invalid board outline polygons."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເລືອກ, ເສັ້ນ Polyline ທີ່ສຳຜັດກັນໃນ DXF ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັນ.\n"
"ຊ່ວຍໃນການປ້ອງກັນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງເສັ້ນຂອບແຜ່ນວົງຈອນ."

#: libs/librepcb/editor/dialogs/dxfimportdialog.ui:127
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::DxfImportDialog"
msgid "Join tangent polylines"
msgstr "ລວມເສັ້ນ Polyline ທີ່ສຳຜັດກັນ"

#: libs/librepcb/editor/dialogs/dxfimportdialog.ui:134
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::DxfImportDialog"
msgid ""
"If checked, circles will be imported as drills.\n"
"If unchecked (the default), circles will be imported as polygons."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເລືອກ, ຮູບວົງມົນຈະຖືກນຳເຂົ້າເປັນຮູເຈາະ (Drills).\n"
"ຖ້າບໍ່ເລືອກ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ຮູບວົງມົນຈະຖືກນຳເຂົ້າເປັນໂພລີກອນ."

#: libs/librepcb/editor/dialogs/dxfimportdialog.ui:138
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::DxfImportDialog"
msgid "Import circles as drills"
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າຮູບວົງມົນເປັນຮູເຈາະ"

#: libs/librepcb/editor/dialogs/dxfimportdialog.cpp:160
