msgid "Import Progress"
msgstr "ຄວາມຄືບໜ້າການນຳເຂົ້າ"

#: libs/librepcb/editor/library/eaglelibraryimportwizard/eaglelibraryimportwizardpage_result.ui:20
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::EagleLibraryImportWizardPage_Result"
msgid "The selected elements will be imported now. For large or complex libraries this can take a few minutes."
msgstr "ອົງປະກອບທີ່ເລືອກຈະຖືກນຳເຂົ້າດຽວນີ້. ສຳລັບຄັງທີ່ມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ ຫຼື ຊັບຊ້ອນ ອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍນາທີ."

#: libs/librepcb/editor/library/eaglelibraryimportwizard/eaglelibraryimportwizardpage_result.ui:26
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::EagleLibraryImportWizardPage_Result"
msgid ""
"<p>After the import, it is highly recommended to perform the following tasks with each of the imported elements:</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"  <li>Assign reasonable categories (if not done yet)</li>\n"
"  <li>Review and rework geometry of symbols and footprints</li>\n"
"  <li>Fix any remaining warnings shown in the library editor</li>\n"
"</ul>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ຫຼັງຈາກນຳເຂົ້າແລ້ວ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ກວດສອບແຕ່ລະອົງປະກອບດັ່ງນີ້:</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"  <li>ກຳນົດໝວດໝູ່ໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມ (ຖ້າຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດ)</li>\n"
"  <li>ກວດສອບ ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງຮູບຊົງຂອງສັນຍະລັກ ແລະ ຟຸດພຣິນ (Footprint)</li>\n"
"  <li>ແກ້ໄຂຄຳເຕືອນຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂຄັງ</li>\n"
"</ul>"

