#: libs/librepcb/editor/library/eaglelibraryimportwizard/eaglelibraryimportwizardpage_selectelements.ui:20
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::EagleLibraryImportWizardPage_SelectElements"
msgid "Select the library elements to import. Dependent elements of devices and components will be selected automatically."
msgstr "ເລືອກອົງປະກອບຂອງຄັງເພື່ອນຳເຂົ້າ. ອົງປະກອບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຂອງອຸປະກອນ ແລະ ສ່ວນປະກອບຈະຖືກເລືອກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

