#: libs/librepcb/editor/guiapplication.cpp:194
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::GuiApplication"
msgid "This workspace was already used with a newer version of LibrePCB. This is fine, just note that any changes in libraries and workspace settings won't be available in newer versions of LibrePCB."
msgstr "ພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກນີ້ເຄີຍຖືກໃຊ້ກັບ LibrePCB ເວີຊັນທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່າ. ບໍ່ເປັນຫຍັງ, ແຕ່ກະລຸນາຮັບຊາບວ່າ ການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆໃນຄັງອຸປະກອນ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃນ LibrePCB ເວີຊັນທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່າ."

#: libs/librepcb/editor/guiapplication.cpp:207
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::GuiApplication"
msgid "No Libraries Installed"
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີຄັງອຸປະກອນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້"

#: libs/librepcb/editor/guiapplication.cpp:208
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::GuiApplication"
msgid "This workspace does not contain any libraries, which are essential to create and modify projects. You should open the libraries panel to add some libraries."
msgstr "ພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກນີ້ບໍ່ມີຄັງອຸປະກອນໃດໆ, ເຊິ່ງຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການສ້າງ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂໂຄງການ. ທ່ານຄວນເປີດແຜງຄັງອຸປະກອນເພື່ອເພີ່ມບາງຄັງອຸປະກອນເຂົ້າໄປ."

#: libs/librepcb/editor/guiapplication.cpp:211
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::GuiApplication"
msgid "Open Library Manager"
msgstr "ເປີດຕົວຈັດການຄັງອຸປະກອນ"

#: libs/librepcb/editor/guiapplication.cpp:228
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::GuiApplication"
msgid "Application is Not Installed"
msgstr "ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#: libs/librepcb/editor/guiapplication.cpp:229
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::GuiApplication"
msgid "This application executable does not seem to be integrated into your desktop environment. If desired, install it now to allow opening LibrePCB projects through the file manager. Click the button for details, or do it from the preferences dialog at any time."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ລັນແອັບນີ້ເບິ່ງຄືວ່າຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຂົ້າກັບລະບົບເດັສທອບຂອງທ່ານ. ຫາກຕ້ອງການ, ຕິດຕັ້ງດຽວນີ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດເປີດໂຄງການ LibrePCB ຜ່ານຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ໄດ້. ຄລິກປຸ່ມເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດ, ຫຼື ເຮັດຜ່ານເມນູການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ທຸກເວລາ."

#: libs/librepcb/editor/guiapplication.cpp:233
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::GuiApplication"
msgid "Install Desktop Integration"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເດັສທອບ"

#: libs/librepcb/editor/guiapplication.cpp:256
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::GuiApplication"
msgid "Light System Theme Detected"
msgstr "ກວດພົບທີມ (Theme) ລະບົບແບບສີແຈ້ງ"

#: libs/librepcb/editor/guiapplication.cpp:257
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::GuiApplication"
msgid "LibrePCB now provides a light theme in addition to the dark theme. It has been activated automatically due to your operating system settings. If you like, you can switch back to the dark theme."
msgstr "ດຽວນີ້ LibrePCB ມີທີມສີແຈ້ງເພີ່ມເຕີມຈາກທີມສີມືດ. ມັນຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຂອງທ່ານ. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການ, ສາມາດປ່ຽນກັບໄປໃຊ້ທີມສີມືດໄດ້."

#: libs/librepcb/editor/guiapplication.cpp:260
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::GuiApplication"
msgid "Use Dark Theme"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ທີມສີມືດ"

#: libs/librepcb/editor/guiapplication.cpp:274
