#: libs/librepcb/editor/project/newprojectwizard/newprojectwizardpage_metadata.ui:134
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::NewProjectWizardPage_Metadata"
msgid "A LibrePCB project consists of a whole directory, not only of a single file. Just select the new project's parent directory, and the subdirectory and filename will be appended automatically."
msgstr "ໂໂຄງການ LibrePCB ປະກອບດ້ວຍໂຟນເດີທັງໝົດ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນພຽງແຕ່ໄຟລ໌ດຽວ. ພຽງແຕ່ເລືອກໂຟນເດີຫຼັກສຳລັບໂຄງການໃໝ່, ແລ້ວໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍ ແລະ ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກຕໍ່ທ້າຍໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

