#: libs/librepcb/editor/project/outputjobsdialog/outputjobsdialog.cpp:261
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::OutputJobsDialog"
msgid "New since LibrePCB 2.0: The fabrication output dialog has been removed in favor of the more powerful output jobs feature."
msgstr "ໃໝ່ໃນ LibrePCB 2.0: ໜ້າຕ່າງການສົ່ງອອກຂໍ້ມູນການຜະລິດໄດ້ຖືກປ່ຽນແທນດ້ວຍຟີເຈີ Output jobs ທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບຫຼາຍກວ່າ."

#: libs/librepcb/editor/project/outputjobsdialog/outputjobsdialog.cpp:265
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::OutputJobsDialog"
msgid "The project does not have a fabrication output job configured yet. At the bottom left of this dialog you can add one of the two pre-configured Gerber/Excellon output jobs and adjust it according your needs."
msgstr "ໂຄງການນີ້ຍັງບໍ່ທັນມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Output job ສໍາລັບການຜະລິດເທື່ອ. ຢູ່ທາງດ້ານລຸ່ມຊ້າຍຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງນີ້ ເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມ Output jobs ແບບ Gerber/Excellon ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#: libs/librepcb/editor/project/outputjobsdialog/outputjobsdialog.cpp:271
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::OutputJobsDialog"
msgid "Or you can import the old settings from LibrePCB 1.x."
