#: libs/librepcb/editor/project/outputjobsdialog/outputjobsdialog.cpp:276
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::OutputJobsDialog"
msgid "Since this project does not have any output jobs at all yet, you may even add a complete set of output jobs instead with the link at the bottom left. Just try it out!"
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກໂຄງການນີ້ຍັງບໍ່ມີ Output jobs ເທື່ອ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມຊຸດ Output jobs ທັງໝົດໄດ້ໂດຍຜ່ານລິ້ງຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມຊ້າຍ. ລອງໃຊ້ເບິ່ງເລີຍ!"

