#: libs/librepcb/editor/workspace/workspacesettingsdialog.ui:799
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::WorkspaceSettingsDialog"
msgid "Internet Access"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າເຖິງອິນເຕີເນັດ"

#: libs/librepcb/editor/workspace/workspacesettingsdialog.ui:805
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::WorkspaceSettingsDialog"
msgid ""
"<html><body>\n"
"<p>API endpoints are used to access online services, for example to download libraries from the Internet.</p>\n"
"<p>You can add any server to this list which implements the LibrePCB API. The official LibrePCB server is <a href=\"https://api.librepcb.org\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#007af4;\">https://api.librepcb.org</span></a>.\n"
"To completely disable Internet access, just remove all entries.</p>\n"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><body>\n"
"<p>API endpoints ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງບໍລິການອອນໄລນ໌, ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ ເພື່ອດາວໂຫຼດຄັງສະສົມຈາກອິນເຕີເນັດ.</p>\n"
"<p>ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມເຊີບເວີໃດກໍໄດ້ເຂົ້າໃນລາຍຊື່ນີ້ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ LibrePCB API. ເຊີບເວີທາງການຂອງ LibrePCB ແມ່ນ <a href=\"https://api.librepcb.org\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#007af4;\">https://api.librepcb.org</span></a>.\n"
"ຫາກຕ້ອງການປິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງອິນເຕີເນັດທັງໝົດ, ໃຫ້ລຶບລາຍການທັງໝົດອອກ.</p>\n"
"</body></html>"

#: libs/librepcb/editor/workspace/workspacesettingsdialog.ui:831
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::WorkspaceSettingsDialog"
msgid "Automatic Library Updates:"
msgstr "ອັບເດດຄັງສະສົມອັດຕະໂນມັດ:"

#: libs/librepcb/editor/workspace/workspacesettingsdialog.ui:854
msgctxt "librepcb::editor::WorkspaceSettingsDialog"
msgid "<p>Allow the editors to automatically display live information about parts (lifecycle status, stock availability, price, ...) by requesting it from the configured API endpoints.</p><p>This may generate many API requests, especially while adding components to schematics.</p><p>If this feature is disabled, no such API requests are made (and no live information is displayed) without explicit user interaction.</p>"
msgstr "<p>ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນສົດກ່ຽວກັບຊິ້ນສ່ວນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ສະຖານະວົງຈອນຊີວິດ, ຈຳນວນສິນຄ້າໃນຄັງ, ລາຄາ, ...) ໂດຍການຮ້ອງຂໍຈາກ API endpoints ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້.</p><p>ນີ້ອາດຈະສ້າງການຮ້ອງຂໍ API ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນຂະນະທີ່ເພີ່ມອຸປະກອນເຂົ້າໃນຜັງວົງຈອນ.</p><p>ຫາກປິດຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, ຈະບໍ່ມີການຮ້ອງຂໍ API (ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນສົດ) ຫາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ສັ່ງໂດຍກົງ.</p>"

