msgid "Learn how to create schematics"
msgstr "ຮຽນຮູ້ວິທີສ້າງຜັງວົງຈອນ"

#: libs/librepcb/ui/project/board/board2dtab.slint:228
msgctxt "Board2dTab"
msgid "Set Up Design Rules"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າກົດລະບຽບການອອກແບບ"

#: libs/librepcb/ui/project/board/board2dtab.slint:234
msgctxt "Board2dTab"
msgid "Before starting with the board design, it is highly recommended to set up the design rules to be used for this board. Just choose one of the presets below, or manually specify the rules."
msgstr "ກ່ອນເລີ່ມການອອກແບບແຜ່ນວົງຈອນ, ແນະນຳຢ່າງຍິ່ງໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າກົດລະບຽບການອອກແບບທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. ພຽງແຕ່ເລືອກຈາກຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນລ່ວງໜ້າ ຫຼື ລະບຸກົດລະບຽບດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#: libs/librepcb/ui/project/board/board2dtab.slint:257
msgctxt "Board2dTab"
msgid "Default rules, suitable for most PCB manufacturers"
msgstr "ກົດລະບຽບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເໝາະສຳລັບຜູ້ຜະລິດ PCB ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່"

#: libs/librepcb/ui/project/board/board2dtab.slint:331
msgctxt "Board2dTab"
msgid "Get Started"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#: libs/librepcb/ui/project/board/board2dtab.slint:337
msgctxt "Board2dTab"
msgid "Start designing the board by placing all devices which are part of the schematics."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມອອກແບບແຜ່ນວົງຈອນໂດຍການວາງອຸປະກອນທັງໝົດທີ່ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຜັງວົງຈອນ."

