#: libs/librepcb/ui/library/cmp/componenttab.slint:447
msgctxt "ComponentSignalsEditorTab"
msgid "Now review & correct the list of signals, if needed (often it is not needed, then just proceed)."
msgstr "ດຽວນີ້ໃຫ້ກວດສອບ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂລາຍຊື່ສັນຍານຫາກຈຳເປັນ (ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແມ່ນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ, ສາມາດດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ໄດ້ເລີຍ)."

#: libs/librepcb/ui/library/cmp/componenttab.slint:448
msgctxt "ComponentSignalsEditorTab"
msgid "If you add or remove any signals, don't forget to update the pinout afterwards (on the next step)!"
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ລຶບສັນຍານໃດໆ, ຢ່າລືມອັບເດດການກຳນົດຂາ (Pinout) ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ!"

#: libs/librepcb/ui/library/cmp/componenttab.slint:454
msgctxt "ComponentSignalsEditorTab"
msgid "This signal list should represent the *electrical* interface of the component, not the *mechanical* pads."
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ສັນຍານນີ້ຄວນສະແດງເຖິງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ *ທາງໄຟຟ້າ* ຂອງອຸປະກອນ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນແຜ່ນຮອງ *ທາງກົນຈັກ*."

#: libs/librepcb/ui/library/cmp/componenttab.slint:455
msgctxt "ComponentSignalsEditorTab"
msgid "For example, if an IC has two or more GND pads which are internally connected, only one GND signal should be added here."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ, ຫາກ IC ມີຂາ GND ສອງຂາ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າເຊິ່ງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນພາຍໃນ, ຄວນເພີ່ມສັນຍານ GND ພຽງອັນດຽວຢູ່ນີ້."

#: libs/librepcb/ui/library/cmp/componenttab.slint:456
msgctxt "ComponentSignalsEditorTab"
msgid "Note that once the component is finished, it is *not* possible anymore to add or remove signals."
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດ: ເມື່ອອຸປະກອນສ້າງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ລຶບສັນຍານໄດ້ອີກ."

#: libs/librepcb/ui/library/cmp/componenttab.slint:459
msgctxt "ComponentSignalsEditorTab"
msgid "Important:"
msgstr "ສຳຄັນ:"

#: libs/librepcb/ui/library/cmp/componenttab.slint:470
msgctxt "ComponentSignalsEditorTab"
msgid "Add Signals:"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມສັນຍານ:"

#: libs/librepcb/ui/library/cmp/componenttab.slint:475
msgctxt "ComponentSignalsEditorTab"
msgid "Signal name (may contain ranges like \"1..5\"; use prefix \"!\" for inverted signals)"
msgstr "ຊື່ສັນຍານ (ອາດຈະໃສ່ເປັນຊ່ວງເຊັ່ນ \"1..5\"; ໃຊ້ \"!\" ນຳໜ້າສຳລັບສັນຍານແບບ Inverted)"

#: libs/librepcb/ui/library/cmp/componenttab.slint:524
msgctxt "ComponentSignalsEditorTab"
