msgstr "ສຳເລັດ"

#: libs/librepcb/ui/library/cmp/componenttab.slint:534
msgctxt "ComponentSignalsEditorTab"
msgid "Back"
msgstr "ກັບຄືນ"

#: libs/librepcb/ui/library/cmp/componenttab.slint:593
msgctxt "ComponentTab"
msgid "Metadata"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາ (Metadata)"

#: libs/librepcb/ui/library/cmp/componenttab.slint:594
msgctxt "ComponentTab"
msgid "Signals"
msgstr "ສັນຍານ"

#: libs/librepcb/ui/library/cmp/componenttab.slint:595
msgctxt "ComponentTab"
msgid "Variants & Gates"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ ແລະ ເກດ"

#: libs/librepcb/ui/library/cmp/componentvariantlistview.slint:379
msgctxt "ComponentVariantListItem"
msgid "Now define the names of the electrical signals of the component in the table below. Usually you can just keep the names from the symbol pins."
msgstr "ດຽວນີ້ໃຫ້ກຳນົດຊື່ສັນຍານໄຟຟ້າຂອງອຸປະກອນໃນຕາຕະລາງລຸ່ມນີ້. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຊື່ດຽວກັນກັບຂາຂອງສັນຍະລັກໄດ້ເລີຍ."

#: libs/librepcb/ui/library/cmp/componentvariantlistview.slint:380
msgctxt "ComponentVariantListItem"
msgid "Note that unconnected or inter-connected pins (i.e. duplicate signal names) are not allowed in this step, but you can rework them on the following pages."
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດ: ຂາທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ຫຼື ຂາທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຖິງກັນ (ເຊັ່ນ ຊື່ສັນຍານຊໍ້າກັນ) ແມ່ນຍັງບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃນຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້, ແຕ່ທ່ານສາມາດປັບປ່ຽນພວກມັນໄດ້ໃນໜ້າຖັດໄປ."

#: libs/librepcb/ui/library/cmp/componentvariantlistview.slint:397
msgctxt "ComponentVariantListItem"
msgid "Variant"
