msgctxt "DeviceContentTab"
msgid "Define the pinout, i.e. connect package pads with component signals. This can be done either manually pad-by-pad or in an automated way by using one of the buttons below."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຜັງຂາ, ເຊັ່ນ: ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແພັດ (Pad) ຂອງແພັກເກດກັບສັນຍານຂອງອົງປະກອບ. ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງເທື່ອລະແພັດ ຫຼື ເຮັດແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍໃຊ້ປຸ່ມດ້ານລຸ່ມນີ້."

#: libs/librepcb/ui/library/dev/devicetab.slint:344
msgctxt "DeviceContentTab"
msgid "Optionally, specify concrete part numbers of this device. These can then be used to generate a bill of materials (BOM) from a project."
